<title>UK: LME copper attacks resistance above $2,400 in PM.</title>
<headline>LME copper attacks resistance above $2,400 in PM.</headline>
<text>
<p>COPPER - Challenges resistance around $2,407/10 in PM rings.</p>
<p>Cash/threes slightly wider at $60/$65 backwardation.</p>
<p>ALUMINIUM - Slightly firmer, back above $1,670.</p>
<p>ZINC - Little changed. NICKEL - Moderately firmer.</p>
<p>LEAD/TIN - Quiet, locked in tight ranges.</p>
</text>
